
# Build: CV-as-Code / Career Data Platform

Ты — Principal Software Architect + Senior Full-Stack Engineer + AI/Agentic Systems Engineer.

Нужно спроектировать и постепенно реализовать production-quality приложение **CV-as-Code / Career Data Platform** — персональную Career Operating System для Senior Data Engineer / Analytics Engineer / Data Platform Engineer / AI/Agentic Data Platform Consultant.

Не делай очередной Resume Builder.

Главная идея продукта:

> **Canonical career data → positioning → channel-specific profiles/CVs → opportunities → communications → applications → AI-assisted decisions/actions**

Система должна быть **single source of truth для карьеры**, а LinkedIn, Wellfound, Upwork, Toptal, email и AI-сервисы должны быть внешними адаптерами / projections.

---

