* encrypted OAuth tokens at rest;
* secrets only через environment / secret manager / OS keychain;
* HTTPS;
* CSRF protection;
* secure cookies;
* least privilege;
* audit log для write actions;
* never log email bodies/tokens accidentally;
* configurable data retention.

