# 72. Product north star

Продукт должен эволюционировать не в:

> Resume Builder.

И не просто в:

> Job Tracker.

А в:

> **Personal Agentic Career Data Platform / Career Operating System**

которая соединяет:

```text
Career Knowledge Base
+
CV-as-Code
+
Profile Management
+
Opportunity Intelligence
+
Career Inbox
+
Application CRM
+
AI Assistants
+
Agentic Workflows
+
Career Analytics
```

Ключевой architecture invariant:

> **Career facts are canonical, channel profiles are projections, opportunities are events, AI outputs are suggestions with provenance, and external actions remain controllable by the user.**

Начинай с архитектурного анализа и P0 vertical slice. Не переусложняй инфраструктуру, но проектируй boundaries так, чтобы последующее добавление Gmail, LinkedIn/Wellfound/Upwork/Toptal adapters, mobile/desktop clients и нескольких AI providers не потребовало переписывания ядра.
